College Event Management Frontend
This is the frontend for the AWS College Event Management system. It is built using React, TypeScript, and Vite for fast development and modern best practices.

Features
User authentication and registration
Browse and register for college events
Event details and schedules
Admin dashboard for managing events
Responsive design for mobile and desktop
Integration with AWS backend services
Tech Stack
React: UI library
TypeScript: Typed JavaScript for scalable apps
Vite: Fast build tool and dev server
AWS: Backend integration (API, authentication, storage)
Getting Started
Prerequisites
Node.js (v16 or newer)
npm or yarn
Installation
bash
git clone https://github.com/AyushSingh0407/AwsCollegeEventManagement.git
cd AwsCollegeEventManagement/Frontend
npm install
Running Locally
bash
npm run dev
The app will be available at http://localhost:5173/ (default Vite port).

Building for Production
bash
npm run build
